### Github Link: [b6star/Agent-Chat-UI-Sample/](https://github.com/b6star/Agent-Chat-UI-Sample/)

This response is a sample sent by **MockAiGateway** in chunks.
To connect a real Provider, create a class implementing `ai/AiGateway` and replace the return value of `aiGateway` in `di/ServiceLocator.kt`.

