    # - Dependency Injection

**Current structure:** This sample uses `ServiceLocator` instead of Hilt. Replacing an implementation only requires changing the provider in one place.

## - Initialization flow
```mermaid
graph TD
    A["AndroidManifest"] --> B["App.onCreate()"]
    B --> C["ServiceLocator initialization"]
    C --> D["Lazy Repository and Gateway creation"]
    D --> E["Used by AgentViewModel"]
```

## - Replacement
```kotlin
// app/src/main/java/com/b6star/chatui/di/ServiceLocator.kt
