    # - Chat Data Storage

**Current state:** `ChatRepository` stores sessions and messages in memory using `MutableStateFlow`. Data is lost when the process ends.

## - Data flow
```mermaid
graph TD
    A["AgentViewModel"] --> B["ChatRepository"]
    B --> C["Session StateFlow"]
    B --> D["Message StateFlow"]
    C --> E["AgentScreen collects Flow"]
    D --> E
```

## - Room migration
    Keep `getSessions()`, `getMessages()`, insert, update, delete, rename, and clear operations so the ViewModel remains stable.

```kotlin
