    # - AiGateway Implementation

## - Contract
    Keep `AiGateway.chatStream()` compatible with `Flow<ChatResponse>`. The concrete provider converts its response chunks into `ChatResponse.Chunk`.

```kotlin
// app/src/main/java/com/b6star/chatui/ai/AiGateway.kt
fun chatStream(...): Flow<ChatResponse>
```
    The `ChatRequest` and `RealAiGateway` code below are simplified conceptual examples. The current sample receives individual history, model, limit, image, and file parameters.

