    # - Operations

## - Security
    Do not log API keys or user messages. Prefer a server proxy for production secrets.
## - Reliability and cost
    Define timeout, retry, rate-limit, model pricing, and usage policies. The current Firebase sample does not implement all of these explicitly.
## - Monitoring
    Record error rate, first-token time, total response time, and token usage.

