    # - AI Connection Prerequisites

## - SDK and network
    Add your Provider SDK to `app/build.gradle.kts` and add the Internet permission to `app/src/main/AndroidManifest.xml`.

```xml
// app/src/main/AndroidManifest.xml
<uses-permission android:name="android.permission.INTERNET" />
```

## - API key
    Keep keys out of source code. Store them in `local.properties`, expose them through `BuildConfig`, and inject them into the real Gateway. For Firebase, use the Firebase project configuration instead of a manually attached Authorization header.

